  "title": "Answer: agency is measured by intervening, and depends on the observer",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "91356ac8-8d88-4dbc-8ac5-c5de0b4682ed",
      "text": "Agency and intelligence are observed by intervening: a system's place on the persuadability axis is found by which kind of intervention best predicts and controls it, and every such estimate is relative to the observer.",
